  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chocoa event</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to give exposure to the combi-tracks cocoa of C&#xF4;te d&apos;Ivoire and Ghana, during Chocoa Amsterdam, and stimulate knowledge exchange and partnership between the different Dutch stakeholders like private companies, NGOs, RVO and the Netherlands embassies.In the end, the project will contribute to the sustainable development of the cocoa sector in C&#xF4;te d&apos;Ivoire and Ghana, hence creating opportunities for local (youth) employment and business opportunities for Dutch products and services that can support this development.</narrative>
  </description>
